{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/y90nupkv","slide":1,"text":"来源：experiments/diagram-in-ppt-luna-09/manuscript.md。页面关系：申请人、平台、管理员、设备负责人之间的消息方向与反馈状态。项目结构检索后，按第二顺位调用Archify sequence，实际候选为run/archify-candidate.json，validate与deliver均通过9/9 showcase检查，输出中间图run/archify-sequence-v2.html。nativeEditablePptx=true。构建脚本实际读取Archify的participants/messages（ID、from/to、label、note、y、variant），再按当前Skin的角色泳道坐标重建为原生连接和文字，模式标记为adapted-native。消息ID到PPT对象映射：submit→message-line-submit/message-label-submit；received→message-line-received/message-label-received；handoff→message-line-handoff/message-label-handoff；ask→message-line-ask/message-label-ask；reply→message-line-reply/message-label-reply；confirm→message-line-confirm/message-label-confirm；confirmed→message-line-confirmed/message-label-confirmed。Archify intermediate仍是流程语义证据，不声称存在通用转换器。"}
